== Bugs ==
{{bug|The Bestiary is bugged with bosses that have multiple parts (such as {{e|Larry Jr.}}, {{e|Pin}}, {{e|The Hollow}}, and so forth):
* For {{e|Pin}}, {{e|The Frail}}, and {{e|Scolex}}, each body part counts as an encounter and a kill.
* For {{e|Larry Jr.}} and {{e|The Hollow}}, only their heads count as a kill but each part counts as an encounter.
* {{e|Satan}}, {{e|War}}, {{e|The Matriarch}} and {{e|Dogma}} kills are not registered.}}
{{bug|{{e|The Visage}}'s mask is not included in the Bestiary (only the Heart is), while both of {{e|Mask of Infamy}}'s halves are included.}}
{{bug|The Sin Collector achievement can be obtained without a full Bestiary. It requires 2 entries less than what is actually featured.}}
{{bug|The Bestiary counts every time {{e|Delirium}} changes forms as separate encounters.}}

